It's not essential.

00:48:46.720 --> 00:48:47.660
The mechanics are bad.

00:48:49.000 --> 00:48:50.320
This is a bad game.

00:48:51.260 --> 00:48:53.160
Sean? Super Pitfall

00:48:53.160 --> 00:48:54.760
is inessential.

